    "body": "The `in-review` label is removed. This issue has no open PR.\n\n- PR #2141 was closed without a merge on 2026-11-16. Its last comment says \"superseded by #2013\".\n- PR #2013 merged on 2026-11-17. Its body does not name this issue.\n- No test on `main` is known to pin this issue. The tests of PR #2141 (`blind_floor::a_blind_hole_shallower_than_one_stepdown_is_cut_at_its_floor`) did not merge.\n\nThe issue stays open and is free for a claim. The first step is a test on `main` that shows if the shallow blind hole is still refused. If `main` cuts the hole, close the issue with that test and name commit of PR #2013.\n",
